OL,3,GNEWSASeven more arrested in A66 fatal
OL,4,Acrash probe
OL,5,
OL,6,FCleveland Police said they were also
OL,7,Fbeing questioned on suspicion of arson
OL,8,Fafter a caravan was set alight on Atlee
OL,9,FRoad in Middlesbrough early on
OL,10,FWednesday.
OL,12,FTwo men, aged 23 and 42, were also
OL,13,Farrested on suspicion of threats to
OL,14,Fkill and a 30-year-old man, on
OL,15,Fsuspicion of possessing criminal
OL,16,Fproperty.
